# The build context of build/Dockerfile, written as an allow-list: only what the image build
# reads is sent to Docker. Everything else (front end, charts, docs, .git) stays out.
*
!pom.xml
!mvnw
!.mvn/
!services/
!libs/
!build/entrypoint.sh
# docs/api/ is copied onto core's classpath (see services/core/pom.xml). Anything new under
# docs/api/ is allowed through automatically; do not narrow this to single files.
!docs/api/

# Build output from a local build would otherwise be copied in with the sources
**/target
